the difference was not significant. Thrombin-antithrombin III complex, fibrinogen degradation product and tissue        
plasminogen activator levels, reflecting activation of the coagulation and fibrinolytic systems, respectively, decreased
uniformly in both groups. We conclude that desmopressin is not useful in reducing blood loss or blood product           
