urine volumes, red blood cell transfusions and blood loss after 24 h between two groups. CONCLUSIONS A single dose of   
DDAVP can reduce the first 6 h blood loss and FFP transfusion postoperatively in patients undergoing valvular heart     
surgery, but has no effect on PLT aggregation."}, {"study_index": 13, "title": "Intranasal desmopressin versus blood    
transfusion in cirrhotic patients with coagulopathy undergoing dental extraction: a randomized controlled trial",       
"abstract": "PURPOSE Cirrhotic patients waiting for liver transplantation who need dental extractions are given fresh   
