randomly divided into two groups) evaluating desmopressin vs placebo in CABG patients taking anti-platelet medicine.    
Patients do not have inherited bleeding disorders - they are taking anti-platelet medication. Meets all inclusion       
criteria.", "confidence": "high"})                                                                                      
                                                                                                                        
