│ RESULTS There were no differences in demographic or surgical characteristics between the DDAVP or placebo groups.    │
│ There was no difference in blood loss and transfusion requirements between the DDAVP and placebo groups. During the  │
│ intraoperative postinfusion time period, the median blood loss for redo patients was 343 versus 357 mL/m2 for        │
│ placebo versus DDAVP, respectively, and for primary patients, the median blood loss was 277 versus 228 mL/m2.        │
│ CONCLUSIONS The prophylactic use of DDAVP to reduce excessive bleeding or transfusion requirements in patients       │
