│ randomized clinical trials", "abstract": "BACKGROUND Perioperative pathologic microvascular bleeding is associated   │
│ with increased morbidity and mortality and could be reduced by hemostatic drugs. At the same time, safety concerns   │
│ regarding existing hemostatic agents include excess mortality. Numerous trials investigating desmopressin have       │
