│ increase postoperative bleeding. The administration of desmopressin to these patients after the neutralization of    │
│ heparin with protamine sulfate does not reduce postoperative bleeding."}, {"study_index": 6, "title": "The role of   │
│ DDAVP (desmopressin) in orthognathic surgery", "abstract": "Desmopressin (1-deamino-8-D-argininevasopressin, DDAVP)  │
│ is a synthetic analog of the antidiuretic hormone L-argininevasopressin. DDAVP has been shown to increase the plasma │
