fibrinolysis of desmopressin in patients undergoing total hip replacement", "abstract": "Twelve patients undergoing     
total hip replacement, with regional anaesthesia and with dextran infusion for plasma expansion and thromboprophylaxis, 
were given the vasopressin analogue desmopressin (DDAVP) or placebo in a randomized, double-blind prospective study. In 
